# Copy to .dev.vars for local dev:  cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars
# For the deployed Worker:          npx wrangler secret put GITHUB_TOKEN
#
# A classic PAT with NO scopes ticked is sufficient — every GitHub endpoint this
# app touches is public read. It exists purely to lift the rate limit from
# 60 req/hr (unauthenticated) to 5000 req/hr.
GITHUB_TOKEN=""
